msy3wfh16rjq2j1730345368.jpg", "title": "智人之上 ——从石器时代到 AI 时代的信息网络简史", "author": "[以]尤瓦尔·赫拉利", "translator": "林俊宏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 4, "chapterTitle": "序言", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}, "commentsCount": 5, "likesCount": 1}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7VYqIBTQX", "review": {"bookId": "3300119145", "content": "二元对立似乎是当今中国人根深蒂固的思想逻辑。“你代表谁？”“你的目的是什么？”“你凭什么？”", "bookVersion": 1968883911, "range": "19434-19791", "abstract": "1848年的《共产党宣言》就指出：“至今所有一切社会的历史都是阶级斗争的历史。自由民和奴隶，贵族和平民，地主和农奴，行会师傅和帮工，简短些说，压迫者和被压迫者，始终处于相互对抗的地位，进行不断的，有时隐蔽，有时公开的斗争。”这种对历史的二元诠释意味着，人类的每一次互动都是压迫者与被压迫者之间的权力斗争。这样一来，某人说了某句话，最重要的问题不是说的内容是什么、说的是不是事实，而是这句话是谁说的、他为谁的特权服务。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 4, "reviewId": "17408780_7VYqIBTQX", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1732545265, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300119145", "format": "epub", "version": 1968883911, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/79/cpplatform_nnjdppmxmsy3wfh16rjq2j/s_cpplatform_nnjdppmxmsy3wfh16rjq2j1730345368.jpg", "title": "智人之上 ——从石器时代到 AI 时代的信息网络简史", "author": "[以]尤瓦尔·赫拉利", "translator": "林俊宏", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 4, "chapterTitle": "序言", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "